    mc "Uau... Essa é uma festa bem grande para um aniversário de vinte e um anos."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 1/01_01_Intro_Heist.rpy:555
translate brazil lb_ep01_intro_02_heist_scene_6b1609c0:

#   hacker "It just shows what you can do when you have a lot of money."
    hacker "Isso só mostra o que você pode fazer quando tem muito dinheiro."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 1/01_01_Intro_Heist.rpy:560
translate brazil lb_ep01_intro_02_heist_scene_3fbdb0e5:

#   leader "Which is the main reason we're here."
    leader "Essa é a principal razão pela qual estamos aqui."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 1/01_01_Intro_Heist.rpy:564
translate brazil lb_ep01_intro_02_heist_scene_678067c4:

#   hacker "There are small cameras setup around the room. We'll be your eyes and ears."
    hacker "Há pequenas câmeras instaladas ao redor da sala. Seremos seus olhos e ouvidos."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 1/01_01_Intro_Heist.rpy:566
translate brazil lb_ep01_intro_02_heist_scene_e572b4f9:

#   mc "Sweet."
    mc "Doce."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 1/01_01_Intro_Heist.rpy:572
translate brazil lb_ep01_intro_02_heist_scene_250ff086:

#   waitress "Something to eat, Sir?"
    waitress "Tem algo para comer, senhor?"

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 1/01_01_Intro_Heist.rpy:574
translate brazil lb_ep01_intro_02_heist_scene_ba347f77:

#   mc "Uh, sure."
    mc "Ah, claro."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 1/01_01_Intro_Heist.rpy:577
translate brazil lb_ep01_intro_02_heist_scene_32898b4c:

#   mc "Nice outfit."
    mc "Que roupa bonita."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 1/01_01_Intro_Heist.rpy:579
translate brazil lb_ep01_intro_02_heist_scene_0a3289a0:

#   mc "Did you get it in the kid's department?"
    mc "Você comprou na seção infantil?"

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 1/01_01_Intro_Heist.rpy:582
translate brazil lb_ep01_intro_02_heist_scene_ecdf13b5:

#   waitress "Oh, shut up, [y_name]! This is all I could get on such short notice."
    waitress "Ah, cala a boca! [y_name] Isso é tudo que consegui com tão pouco tempo de aviso."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 1/01_01_Intro_Heist.rpy:584
translate brazil lb_ep01_intro_02_heist_scene_76354a8f:

#   mc "And I thought you were the expert on disguises and makeup."
    mc "E eu que pensava que você era especialista em disfarces e maquiagem."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 1/01_01_Intro_Heist.rpy:586
translate brazil lb_ep01_intro_02_heist_scene_16cb2a35:

#   waitress "At least I don't look like that doofus from {i}Kings County Nine-Nine{/i}!"
    waitress "Pelo menos eu não me pareço com aquele idiota do {i} Condado de Kings Nine-Nine{/i}!"

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 1/01_01_Intro_Heist.rpy:590
translate brazil lb_ep01_intro_02_heist_scene_798c3f51:

#   leader "Cram it, you two."
    leader "Engulam essa, vocês dois."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 1/01_01_Intro_Heist.rpy:595
translate brazil lb_ep01_intro_02_heist_scene_64543c60:

#   leader "We're here to do a job."
    leader "Estamos aqui para fazer um trabalho."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 1/01_01_Intro_Heist.rpy:596
translate brazil lb_ep01_intro_02_heist_scene_4efc33b6:

#   leader "And if you keep up the stupid banter, it will be all over before it even begins."
    leader "E se vocês continuarem com essa conversa fiada, tudo vai acabar antes mesmo de começar."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 1/01_01_Intro_Heist.rpy:598
translate brazil lb_ep01_intro_02_heist_scene_c74fa6ca:

#   mc "Okay, fine."
    mc "Ok, tudo bem."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 1/01_01_Intro_Heist.rpy:600
translate brazil lb_ep01_intro_02_heist_scene_5a13bfbe:

#   mc "Is there anything else you can tell me?"
    mc "Há mais alguma coisa que você possa me dizer?"

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 1/01_01_Intro_Heist.rpy:605
translate brazil lb_ep01_intro_02_heist_scene_84d1a492:

#   hacker "The main office is upstairs. It's the last door."
    hacker "O escritório principal fica no andar de cima. É a última porta."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 1/01_01_Intro_Heist.rpy:606
translate brazil lb_ep01_intro_02_heist_scene_7bf37828:

#   hacker "All security is either on the ground floor or outside."
    hacker "Toda a segurança está localizada no térreo ou na área externa."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 1/01_01_Intro_Heist.rpy:611
translate brazil lb_ep01_intro_02_heist_scene_50fa910d:

#   waitress "They've been doing random checks for each room to make sure everything's locked and secured."
    waitress "Eles têm feito verificações aleatórias em cada quarto para garantir que tudo esteja trancado e seguro."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 1/01_01_Intro_Heist.rpy:613
translate brazil lb_ep01_intro_02_heist_scene_f5320476:

#   mc "What about those two guys over there?"
    mc "E quanto àqueles dois caras ali?"

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 1/01_01_Intro_Heist.rpy:616
translate brazil lb_ep01_intro_02_heist_scene_dcd162aa:

#   waitress "I'll distract them when the boy's mother brings out the birthday cake."
    waitress "Vou distraí-los quando a mãe do menino trouxer o bolo de aniversário."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 1/01_01_Intro_Heist.rpy:618
translate brazil lb_ep01_intro_02_heist_scene_3c1e99c2:

#   waitress "That should be any second now."
    waitress "Isso deve acontecer a qualquer momento."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 1/01_01_Intro_Heist.rpy:621
translate brazil lb_ep01_intro_02_heist_scene_0f9894c5:

#   waitress "There she is. She's about to place the cake down on the table."
    waitress "Ali está ela. Ela está prestes a colocar o bolo sobre a mesa."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 1/01_01_Intro_Heist.rpy:623
translate brazil lb_ep01_intro_02_heist_scene_2965c177:

#   mc "Now's the time to make our move."
    mc "Agora é a hora de agirmos."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 1/01_01_Intro_Heist.rpy:625
translate brazil lb_ep01_intro_02_heist_scene_116f919b:

#   waitress "Okay, I'll create a diversion."
    waitress "Certo, vou criar uma distração."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 1/01_01_Intro_Heist.rpy:628
translate brazil lb_ep01_intro_02_heist_scene_9b500b48:

#   mc "All right, you do that while I slowly make my way towards the stairs."
    mc "Muito bem, faça isso enquanto eu me dirijo lentamente em direção às escadas."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 1/01_01_Intro_Heist.rpy:633
translate brazil lb_ep01_intro_02_heist_scene_fd7dee2a:

#   hacker "Your path looks clear, [y_name]."
    hacker "Seu caminho parece livre, [y_name]."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 1/01_01_Intro_Heist.rpy:638
translate brazil lb_ep01_intro_02_heist_scene_b60cf7ee:

#   mc "Yeah, [b_name] currently has the security guys covered."
    mc "Sim, [b_name] Atualmente, a equipe de segurança está sob controle."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 1/01_01_Intro_Heist.rpy:641
translate brazil lb_ep01_intro_02_heist_scene_d8639921:

#   mc "That's my cue."
    mc "Essa é a minha deixa."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 1/01_01_Intro_Heist.rpy:644
translate brazil lb_ep01_intro_02_heist_scene_08ab4d8b:

#   mc "A walk in the park."
    mc "Um passeio no parque."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 1/01_01_Intro_Heist.rpy:646
translate brazil lb_ep01_intro_02_heist_scene_cc28ea8e:

#   mc "I'm heading up the stairs."
    mc "Estou subindo as escadas."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 1/01_01_Intro_Heist.rpy:650
translate brazil lb_ep01_intro_02_heist_scene_5038a4c0:

#   hacker "You're almost there. The two guys on the floor are still talking with [b_name]."
    hacker "Você está quase lá. Os dois caras no chão ainda estão conversando com [b_name]."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 1/01_01_Intro_Heist.rpy:655
translate brazil lb_ep01_intro_02_heist_scene_99003865:

#   mc "Yeah, \"talking\"..."
    mc "Sim, \"conversando\"..."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 1/01_01_Intro_Heist.rpy:657
translate brazil lb_ep01_intro_02_heist_scene_543b17f4:

#   mc "Okay, I'm on the top floor."
    mc "Ok, estou no último andar."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 1/01_01_Intro_Heist.rpy:659
translate brazil lb_ep01_intro_02_heist_scene_acad3c79:

#   leader "Make your way to the office door before security sees you."
    leader "Dirija-se à porta do escritório antes que a segurança o veja."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 1/01_01_Intro_Heist.rpy:661
translate brazil lb_ep01_intro_02_heist_scene_63345ea8:

#   mc "Doing that right now, over..."
    mc "Fazendo isso agora mesmo, por causa de..."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 1/01_01_Intro_Heist.rpy:288
translate brazil lb_ep01_intro_02_heist_scene_c0ac1853_1:

#   hacker "Haha!"
    hacker "Haha!"

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 1/01_01_Intro_Heist.rpy:416
translate brazil lb_ep01_intro_02_heist_scene_f4442efe_1:

#   mc "(Oh shit!)"
    mc "(Ah Merda!)"

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 1/01_01_Intro_Heist.rpy:474
translate brazil lb_ep01_intro_02_heist_scene_5bea82d2_1:

#   mc "Who, me?"
    mc "Quem, eu?"

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 1/01_01_Intro_Heist.rpy:476
translate brazil lb_ep01_intro_02_heist_scene_fda4c848_1:

#   head_chef "Yeah, you."
    head_chef "Sim, você."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 1/01_01_Intro_Heist.rpy:477
translate brazil lb_ep01_intro_02_heist_scene_ecef2bbe_1:

#   head_chef "What are you doing in my kitchen?"
    head_chef "O que você está fazendo na minha cozinha?"

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 1/01_01_Intro_Heist.rpy:505
translate brazil lb_ep01_intro_02_heist_scene_c3f3c502_1:

#   mc "I’m sure you don’t want Mr. Walker to hear about his son’s dissatisfaction with the food being supplied for his birthday, do you?"
    mc "Tenho certeza de que você não quer que o Sr. Walker saiba da insatisfação do filho com a comida servida em seu aniversário, não é?"

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 1/01_01_Intro_Heist.rpy:508
translate brazil lb_ep01_intro_02_heist_scene_d1df2e2c_1:

#   head_chef "No, not at all."
    head_chef "Não, de forma alguma."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 1/01_01_Intro_Heist.rpy:510
translate brazil lb_ep01_intro_02_heist_scene_f1cd3704_1:

#   head_chef "Don't worry, I'll have my staff replace all the food outside, posthaste!"
    head_chef "Não se preocupe, pedirei à minha equipe que substitua toda a comida que está lá fora o mais rápido possível!"

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 1/01_01_Intro_Heist.rpy:512
translate brazil lb_ep01_intro_02_heist_scene_640b983c_1:

#   mc "Be sure that you do."
    mc "Certifique-se de que o faça."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 1/01_01_Intro_Heist.rpy:518
translate brazil lb_ep01_intro_02_heist_scene_cf72da4b_1:

#   mc "Very good."
    mc "Muito bom."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 1/01_01_Intro_Heist.rpy:521
translate brazil lb_ep01_intro_02_heist_scene_887db35f_1:

#   hacker "Good work, [y_name]. I think he bought it."
    hacker "Bom trabalho, [y_name] Acho que ele comprou."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 1/01_01_Intro_Heist.rpy:523
translate brazil lb_ep01_intro_02_heist_scene_34f78a59_1:

#   mc "Seems like it."
    mc "Parece que sim."

